    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maheemajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA bea giihiimnooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi abeeda gaysina maheemajeanda ghaydit aba hang'weaka damanamughuush bea gulbeenga miyaasiin siireata iyeenya nea gameaji ea duw ea dea oomu ea dea sisna gulbeeda areara; ea geeruubajeega was gadiyeeda gearinda nih gichea sinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geawunda hang'weaka gaygaba nih bea geatin diktam ea sis, ak murdajeega gaba nih bea geatin ang'wan, hang'weaka sean gaygooyang'deay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hang'weak muut roopsiinyeena ghoah hang'agi, ak giiroonyi suurja muut ghoah hang'agi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ginapsi geeshta hang'da ghealooda oormeeda gasa gwatuudu, oormeanagi gaynapsiina hang'weakiga bea madeedean inapsiinyiini ak gaysindunu eara meatkweedeaba iyeenya bea hang'weaka inapsiinyi bea iyeenyean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina gilibuut haradam ea damanamughuush aba hang'agi, ak gisini gilibuut haradam ea damanamughuush aba weeloojiga hang'da nea meatkweedeaba iyeenya; nea gilibuutka gaygafursiinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina gifungaji haradam ea damanamughuush bea dahaabu, ak giiguuyeewi hang'weaka aba gifungajeegiga, ak gayghoah maheemajeandida agi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gisini gicha hang'weaka buudeega nooga ghoah maheemajeanda aba heeda giibinda sina hang'weaka damwanagi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hang'agi geawundaanyi gaygaba geatin diktam ea damanamughuush, ak murdajeega gaba geatin ang'wan, hang'weaksu atamwanagiin gaygooyang'deay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaynapsiinyeena hang'weak muut nea gabwageat ak ginapsiinyi hang'weak lah nea gabwageat ak gigilibi hang'dida bea lahiin aba madeeda maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gisini ghealooni haradam ea damanamughuush weeleeda hang'dida washiin sinapsiinyiin bea madeedean ea ghealooni haradam ea damanamughuush weeleeda hang'dida washiin sinapsiinyi bea iyeenyean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gisini gifungaji haradam ea damanamughuush oomng'i, ak giyiini gifungajeega jeeda ghealooniga, ak gikuli geat maheemajeega ghoah agi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak weasta abit bea hang'weaka maheemajeanda, hang'dida abit agweena silach nibiyeenyean ghasta aba uuta maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geatinda naawda aba meatkweenagi, ea geatinda naawda aba meatkweeda niirja, bea geawunda hang'weaka abit bea maheemajeanda abeeda gayghasta aba murdajeega maheemajeanda, meatkweeni ea meatkweedida ak gwadukuta maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gisini gida jea eedukuteawa ghuuta maheemajeanda, was eagweega lagweendiga ea gea nooga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sina beehajeega ak gimiindi jea gaba maheemajeanda was geediga rabeangheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygaba beehiida geatin damanamughuush geawundaanyi ak murdajeega beehiida gaygaba nih bea geatinagi ea gidagween iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygaba beehiini mideawa geatin iyeenya, ak geeroopsiinyi duwaawi, ak gaysindunu aba beehajeega sean bea maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina beehajeega maheemajeanda, beehaji diktam bea wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gisini hoorgaji haradam bea lapiya, ak giyiini hing'eadayda beehajeega atiktam, ak hoorgaji iyeenya gayghoang'waay ghuusigiga iyeenyean ak giyiini gicha hoorgaji iyeenya hing'eadayda beehajeega suurja ak ghoang'waay ghuusigiga iyeenyean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea meatkweedeaba iyeenya bea maheemajeanda, was wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa beehaji diktam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea hoorgajeega nyaawa bea lapiya was haradam ak gwanda hoorgaji iyeenya hiing'eadayba beehiinagi, ak hoorgaji iyeenya giyiin hiing'eadayba beehi nuut; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea beehaji lah gaygaba uuta maheemajeanda bea meatkweeda biyeara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata gaysina beehaji iyeenya jea ghawashiini aba uuta maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meatkweeda hiing'aada gaygwaheeli, ak gaygwaroonyeesa heetiyeada bea ghuniida madeeda, ak ea gichea gawuurji gil sean; ak gaygwasin ghwanuut iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gaygwanda beehaji sis ea hoorgajeega nyaawa bea lapiya, hoorgajeega damwalah; ak geayiin hoorgaji iyeenya hiing'eadayba agi ak geayiin hoorgaji iyeenya hiing'eadayba hoorga nuut.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lakni daranajeega geeta was rabeangheeda, daranaji muut jea ghoah beehajeega meatkweenagi bea maheemajeanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea daranaji muut bea beehajeega bea meatkweeda niirja bea maheemajeanda, ea daranaji muut bea beehajeega bea meatkweeda niirja bea maheemajeanda bea meatkweeda biyeara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak daraneeda mida bugusta beehiida suurja gayghang'ata ghang'eada huuydeanda ea gawa huuydeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydukuta beehajeega aba dahaabu, ak gaysisiina ghunoojiga dahaabu jea ghwasar daranajeega, ak gidukuti daranajeega aba dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
