        {
          "text": "“Ak gaysina hang'da beashooda bea oormeeda gasa gwatuudu guuyi oormeeda gasa ghwahareariit ea dea areara ea hang'weaka bumbuni miyaas, siiyeat ak weeleeda hang'da ea ninapsa siida ammu sinooda suulga giduurji geeruubajeega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.31",
