          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asheagiideawana meeseedida heeda hang'dida bea beashooda ak heeda siyiina gheaboonyaneeda iina meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara bea maheemajeanda deaschi measa, ak giyiini measa wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa.",
          "type": "text",
