          "text": "“Ak gaysina weasta haw bea hang'weaka bumbuni bea gidaghuuta maheemajeanda, bea oormeeda gasa gwatuudu guuyi oormeeda gasa ghwahareariit ea dea areara, ea hang'da bumbuni miy sinaaw aba gadiyeeda siida nabiischeewa gearinda. ",
