        },
        {
          "text": "Weasta haw bea gidaghuudiin sisiina daranaji muut bea rabeangheeda, ak gidukuti aba dahaabu, ak gifungajeagaaschi gaygaba dahaabu, ak gisisi saawa hoorgajeega oomng'i.",
